WEBVTT

00:00:04.104 --> 00:00:11.977
Typecase never goes online, so it doesn't look for updates by itself. Now and then, compare your version with the newest one.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:17.976
Your version is in the menu, under About Typecase. This one has 1.2.1.

00:00:21.882 --> 00:00:29.563
The newest version is on kleinod.studio/typecase, right below the buttons. Here it's 1.3.0.

00:00:29.869 --> 00:00:35.289
Download it, just like the first time: click Get Typecase, then the button for your computer.

00:00:39.081 --> 00:00:50.495
The Software app can't update from a downloaded file, so open the Terminal. Type sudo flatpak install and the start of the file name, then press Tab: the Terminal completes it.

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:54.706
Press Enter, type your password, and confirm with Enter once more.

00:00:57.563 --> 00:01:05.778
Your texts and settings stay as they are. Open Typecase again and look at About Typecase: now it has 1.3.0.

00:01:11.032 --> 00:01:20.036
Tip: run sudo flatpak update now and then, to keep the parts Typecase builds on up to date. You'll find the commands below this video.

00:01:20.936 --> 00:01:23.668
Typecase. Free software, made for GNOME.

00:01:23.968 --> 00:01:26.550
With love, by kleinod.studio.
